    "['[parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'mpls ip', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nmpls ip\\n##\\n\\nExplanation: \\n- In Huawei's configuration, the `mpls` command enables MPLS globally on the device. \\n- The Cisco equivalent is `mpls ip`, which enables MPLS forwarding for IP on the router.\\n- Note that Cisco requires additional interface-level configuration (`mpls ip`) to enable MPLS on specific interfaces, which isn't shown here since we're only translating the global command.\", 'trans_template': 'mpls ip'}]]": 1,
