    "['mpls rsvp-te', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'mpls traffic-eng signalling rsvp', 'parent_command': ['mpls ip'], 'root': 'interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nmpls traffic-eng signalling rsvp\\n##\\n\\nThe Cisco equivalent of Huawei's `mpls rsvp-te` command (which enables RSVP-TE signaling for MPLS TE tunnels) is `mpls traffic-eng signalling rsvp` in Cisco IOS. This command enables RSVP as the signaling protocol for MPLS Traffic Engineering tunnels.\", 'trans_template': 'mpls traffic-eng signalling rsvp'}]]": 1,
