    "['tunnel-protocol [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'tunnel mode mpls traffic-eng', 'parent_command': ['interface [parameter1]'], 'root': 'interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the equivalent Cisco command for `tunnel-protocol mpls te`:\\n\\n##\\ntunnel mode mpls traffic-eng\\n##\\n\\nThis Cisco command configures the tunnel interface to use MPLS Traffic Engineering (TE) as its encapsulation mode, which is the equivalent functionality to Huawei's `tunnel-protocol mpls te` command.\", 'trans_template': 'tunnel mode mpls traffic-eng'}]]": 1,
